{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, נְדַב","hw":"נְדַב","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">נְדַב</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. </strong><br><strong>Hithpa.</strong>  <strong> volunteer, offer freely (</strong>𝔗; BH <span dir=\"rtl\">נָדַב</span><strong>)</strong>;—Pf. 3 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְנַדַּ֫בוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:15\" href=\"/Ezra.7.15\">Ezr 7:15</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְנִדָּבוּת</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:16\" href=\"/Ezra.7.16\">16</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִתְנַדַּב</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:13\" href=\"/Ezra.7.13\">13</a>; pl. -<span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבִין</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:16\" href=\"/Ezra.7.16\">16</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>volunteer</em>, sq. inf., <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:13\" href=\"/Ezra.7.13\">Ezr 7:13</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  <em>give</em>, or <em>offer freely</em>, v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:15\" href=\"/Ezra.7.15\">15</a>, acc. rei + ל of God; v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:16\" href=\"/Ezra.7.16\">16</a>, c. ל of temple; <em>freewill gift</em> (inf., proposes <em>freewill giving</em>) v <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:16\" href=\"/Ezra.7.16\">16</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, נִדְבָּךְ","prev":"BDB Aramaic, נֹ֫גַהּ"}